Verdict: GAP
- (6) endpoint: continuity does not imply finite alpha_r when r = rho_max (counterexample h = min(eps, sqrt((y-rho_max)^+))); require r < rho_max or h = O(y - rho_max).
- (6) counting: the positive-height pairing is rho <-> 1 - conj(rho), not rho <-> conj(rho); distinct pairs only decrease the nonnegative sum.
